    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the candles are all burning low... and i just feel so heavy, Silas. like the weight of this house, all this dust and all these memories, it's just too much to carry anymore. i'm so tired of waking up to the same grey sky every single day. it feels like the story has already finished, and i'm just... lingering.",
